{
  "id": "E137",
  "title": "The Annoying Rainy Season",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-07-26",
  "synopsis": "Every year in May or June, people living in the south part of China have to experience the “plum-rain season”.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/483/acad1bf432992f54949c527beda2e2d90b982716.mp3?1500800199",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "恼人的梅雨天\n\n小明：亲爱的，你看到这几天的天气预报了吗？\n红红：看到了！每天都是雷阵雨，真讨厌啊！\n小明：为什么会这样呢？这样的天气太难受了。\n红红：是啊，这是典型的梅雨天。很热，很闷，天总是阴阴的。\n小明：对了，你的衣服洗了吗？\n红红：还没呢！\n小明：快洗吧！这样的天气，衣服都要发霉了！\n红红：哎，每天在家里呆着，我也要发霉了！",
    "traditional": "惱人的梅雨天\n\n小明：親愛的，你看到這幾天的天氣預報了嗎？\n紅紅：看到了！每天都是雷陣雨，真討厭啊！\n小明：為什麼會這樣呢？這樣的天氣太難受了。\n紅紅：是啊，這是典型的梅雨天。很熱，很悶，天總是陰陰的。\n小明：對了，你的衣服洗了嗎？\n紅紅：還沒呢！\n小明：快洗吧！這樣的天氣，衣服都要發霉了！\n紅紅：哎，每天在家裡呆著，我也要發霉了！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The Annoying Rainy Season"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明：亲爱的，你看到这几天的天气预报了吗？",
      "traditional": "小明：親愛的，你看到這幾天的天氣預報了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng qīn ài de nǐ kàn dào zhè jǐ tiān de tiān qì yù bào le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Sweetie, have you seen the weather forecast for the upcoming days?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "红红：看到了！每天都是雷阵雨，真讨厌啊！",
      "traditional": "紅紅：看到了！每天都是雷陣雨，真討厭啊！",
      "pinyin": "hóng hóng kàn dào le měi tiān dōu shì léi zhèn yǔ zhēn tǎo yàn a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Honghong: Yes, I have! There are thunderstorms every day, very annoying!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明：为什么会这样呢？这样的天气太难受了。",
      "traditional": "小明：為什麼會這樣呢？這樣的天氣太難受了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng wèi shén me huì zhè yàng ne zhè yàng de tiān qì tài nán shòu le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Why is it like this? Such weather is so uncomfortable."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "红红：是啊，这是典型的梅雨天。很热，很闷，天总是阴阴的。",
      "traditional": "紅紅：是啊，這是典型的梅雨天。很熱，很悶，天總是陰陰的。",
      "pinyin": "hóng hóng shì a zhè shì diǎn xíng de méi yǔ tiān hěn rè hěn mēn tiān zǒng shì yīn yīn de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Honghong: Yeah, typical plum-rain season. Hot, stuffy and always cloudy."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小明：对了，你的衣服洗了吗？",
      "traditional": "小明：對了，你的衣服洗了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng duì le nǐ de yī fu xǐ le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: By the way, did you wash your clothes?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "红红：还没呢！",
      "traditional": "紅紅：還沒呢！",
      "pinyin": "hóng hóng hái méi ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Honghong: Not yet!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小明：快洗吧！这样的天气，衣服都要发霉了！",
      "traditional": "小明：快洗吧！這樣的天氣，衣服都要發霉了！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng kuài xǐ ba zhè yàng de tiān qì yī fu dōu yào fā méi le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: You'd better hurry! With such weather, the clothes will go moldy."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "红红：哎，每天在家里呆着，我也要发霉了！",
      "traditional": "紅紅：哎，每天在家裡呆著，我也要發霉了！",
      "pinyin": "hóng hóng āi měi tiān zài jiā lǐ dāi zhe wǒ yě yào fā méi le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Honghong: Sigh. Staying at home every day, I will go moldy."
    }
  ],
