    "sentence_translations": [
      "The Annoying Rainy Season",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Sweetie, have you seen the weather forecast for the upcoming days?",
      "",
      "Honghong: Yes, I have! There are thunderstorms every day, very annoying!",
      "",
      "Little Ming: Why is it like this? Such weather is so uncomfortable.",
      "",
      "Honghong: Yeah, typical plum-rain season. Hot, stuffy and always cloudy.",
      "",
      "Little Ming: By the way, did you wash your clothes?",
      "",
      "Honghong: Not yet!",
      "",
      "Little Ming: You'd better hurry! With such weather, the clothes will go moldy.",
      "",
      "Honghong: Sigh. Staying at home every day, I will go moldy.",
      ""
    ]
  }
